<http://data.silknow.org/object/1ee78cdb-2c86-3a1a-b5bd-482fdd6ff426>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Pair of woman's shoes, silk damask, ca. 1750, England"@en , "10. Pair of shoes\n1750–60\nLondon\nGresham\nSilk damask, silk, linen and leather\nV&A: T.31&A-1912\n\nReady-made Shoes (Object No. 10)\nThe mid 18th century saw the growth of the modern shoe shop and the market for ready-made shoes. This pair of shoes was sold by Gresham in Covent Garden. The shop was comparable to a high-end high-street shop today. The shoes retain the original brand label, which is the oldest shoe label in the V&A’s collection. [2015]"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/0e464972-5b0c-33c2-8d99-6504a77d98c7> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/34f9b544-f62d-3960-a045-3ff5a9a5ea87> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/d137a406-8595-3d57-afde-370912ee0632> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/97da370b-ba0b-3302-9df7-b3948431d596> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/1794d7e3-e97c-3bf4-ab3b-2d32315b307c> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/9a0e613f-9789-374c-8b8a-1fc55aeaa317> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/53da75c0-9c72-308e-becb-72fac7c302d6> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/a12f8e3e-b42a-347c-877b-fc8ec636923e> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "10. Pair of shoes\n1750–60\nLondon\nGresham\nSilk damask, silk, linen and leather\nV&A: T.31&A-1912\n\nReady-made Shoes (Object No. 10)\nThe mid 18th century saw the growth of the modern shoe shop and the market for ready-made shoes. This pair of shoes was sold by Gresham in Covent Garden. The shop was comparable to a high-end high-street shop today. The shoes retain the original brand label, which is the oldest shoe label in the V&A’s collection. [2015]"@en , "Pair of woman's shoes, silk damask, ca. 1750, England"@en ;
        dc:identifier                  "T.31-1912" ;
        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs>
                <https://collections.vam.ac.uk/item/O353818> .

